{"server":"cn","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_st02","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_st02","title":"午夜龙门","storyCode":"CB-ST2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_st02.txt","sourceHash":"5844262001bafeddecc167d5505499f32884964c3d67ff1fb05d0cf1bf6ed580","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"甘比诺与卡彭的决斗再次被槐琥与孑打断。这两位龙门年轻人一定要让肆意妄为的黑手党付出代价。同时，鼠王在墓地约见了一位老友。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"0:00 A.M.    天气/沙尘\n龙门市区，商业街"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你知道你现在的表情很吓人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......你回来了，那些人你调查清楚了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"稍微有一些眉目，虽然很想把那些胡作非为的家伙绳之以法，但似乎不是我一个人就能解决的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定要拜托事务所的那些家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"对方势力不小，阿那个家伙，又不肯直接告诉我，故弄玄虚的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"哪个家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"阿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......他就叫阿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......那，总而言之，不是什么轻松的事情对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"我来帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......你没听明白吗？如果只是那些混混倒还好说，可如果是一个有组织有规模的帮派组织，我们当然不能轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"“不能轻举妄动”，也不是毫无办法，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然会和我抠字眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"我没在开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿伯他没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"伤不重，但这已经不重要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"——没错，的确不重要了。如果只是黑吃黑的案子，我才不想多管闲事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"但在我的眼前伤及无辜，我可不能由着他们胡作非为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢，之后请你吃鱼丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"鱼丸就不必了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚的事件，也和企鹅物流有关系。他们根本没打算掩饰，一点都没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不是坏人，大概也是被卷进去的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"今年到现在已经被卷进去几十次了？他们应该更注意一点，不要总是惹是生非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有机会见到他们，有必要警告他们一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"沙子，源石技艺，法术，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"想来也是，掌控龙门暗面的怪物，总不能真的是个花架子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"难道卡彭先生的意思是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是最不该招惹的人，不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王？但是，我们岂不是要同时对付首领、企鹅物流，还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"还有半座龙门。没错，情况不容乐观，所以，一步都不能走错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"卡、卡彭先生，您这是做什么？请把弩放下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为背叛家族真的是一件小事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"愿意追随我在龙门扎根，做好了不惜背叛甘比诺也要活下去的准备，我记得他们每一个人的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"而你并不在其列，甘比诺的走狗，去死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"滚出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为你只是个忘恩负义的混账，看来你收买人心还是很有一套的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，这还是你教我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么不记得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾经赢得过我的效忠，再让我失望至极，我可不会重蹈覆辙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"背叛意味着什么，你应该明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"背叛是叙拉古最肮脏的罪名，但可惜，你所拥戴的荣誉在龙门毫无价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"收下这个吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——黑桃J？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，你藏牌的速度太慢了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你的剑更迟钝了，甘比诺，和企鹅物流的厮杀让你负伤了吗？还是说，旧伤复发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你的懦弱让我感到心寒，我只是在考虑怎样的血腥下场才适合叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你才是多余的那张牌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢？你打算做什么？打败企鹅物流，打败鼠王，打败龙门近卫局，再打败魏彦吾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"反正都要做梦，不如就别醒了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，至少我会把你的骨灰送回叙拉古。或者，让你的故乡把你的尸骸碾成粉末。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站住，你们是——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，有人搅局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......没能快点杀了你是我的错，但是，先迎接一下外来者吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拦住他们！唔呃！竟然踩我脚趾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙，炎国功夫！？根本碰不到她啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是赤手空拳怎么做到——噗哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"——呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，就是你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不想滥杀无辜，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你一路穿过我的队伍，走到我的面前，衣服都没沾染上一点灰尘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你是鼠王的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们，刚才在贫民窟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"打断了西西里人的决斗，还胆敢发问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，那看来就是你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"这个家伙，呃，怎么回事——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么看着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"别误会，借刀杀人也未尝不可，但我必须亲自送他上路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"可是依我看......你也不像是盏省油的灯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我认真建议你投降。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"笑话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你和那只狼的身手相当，没想到鼠王还藏着你这样的底牌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"什么底牌，完全不知道你在说什么。乖乖趴下和我去见警员吧——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我想起来了，我见过你，你是那个伪装成生鲜贩子的打手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我本以为你不是需要特别关注的对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那其实是个误会......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，现在，就当我是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你被一个小姑娘欺负得够呛，甘比诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"杀你的事情稍后再提，不要高兴得太早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......你有好几次想要乘机偷袭，卑劣的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"拳峰不正，如何取胜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你们会为自己肆意妄为的暴行付出代价。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cenmetery"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你让我等这么久，就为了把我带到这儿来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？开始为我物色墓地了？还是想和我死了之后当邻居？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你做了这么多年生意，怎么嘴巴还是这么毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可不会对客人这个态度，你又不是客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"真伤感情啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这是阿发的墓，你也许不认识吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是癞子陈的，这是假阎王的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"后边住着老吴和铁疯子，还有安老八，安老八家里有钱，给他安置在山坡上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"人很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还好，至少都是邻居。我们也该想想以后的住处了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"现在想这个还太早了，还是说，你其实得了什么绝症？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也不早了。我们活得不够久，所以总觉得自己经历了很多大风大浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像我这种人，兄弟们用命把我们救下来了，过几天安稳日子，回头再想想自己这辈子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像也没多大个事，毕竟干大事的，都过不上安稳日子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什么，卖个鱼丸卖得大彻大悟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，买菜涨价比黑手党要命的多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......头儿，你真不考虑让我以后做你邻居？我看这里风水奇好，听说墓地联买会便宜不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"够了没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"开个玩笑，玩笑。哎，你好歹还有个女儿，我就是个孤家寡人咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不是有贫民窟的那些孩子跟着你吗？还有那个叫阿孑的小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和血亲终究是不一样的，老了之后，才会真正意识到这点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——所以你要活得比我久一点，但也不要太久，稍微久一点就好，我在下面等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是铁了心要找机会呛我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，过会还要再去见个老朋友，要来喝一杯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不了，我怕阿孑那小子真的去惹事，得去看着点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我会帮你看着点的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我还剩几个活着的老朋友？不都在这儿了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——我和姓魏的聊不来，和他打交道久了，真的会短命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但当年帮魏彦吾挡下一枚流弹，这辈子都没法直着腿走路的人，是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我想吗？靠，别提这件事，我一直感觉自己亏惨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......但至少龙门可以直着腿走路了，也不亏吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，一点没变，不过这样也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真的不想见他，就先走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"而且他见到你，我怕也没什么话说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你总算肯放我走了，我好歹也是个伤员，林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"姓董的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没听见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"活久一点，多卖点鱼丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"先考虑在龙门买个门面，开家店，收几个徒弟，然后再想想棺材搁哪儿，不着急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王还活着，轮不到你们送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......得嘞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]}]}
